msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:10
msgid ""
"This chapter helps you get started quickly with `Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin` "
"through simple examples."
msgstr "本章通过简单示例帮助您快速上手 `Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:12
msgid "Training Workflow & Concepts"
msgstr "训练工作流与概念"

