msgid "Objective"
msgstr "目标函数"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:52
msgid "`objective(h, s)`"
msgstr "`objective(h, s)`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:92
msgid ""
"**Note:** BM uses `condition_sample()` because fully-connected networks "
"require sampling conditioned on visible units, not a deterministic hidden-"
"layer computation."
msgstr "**注意：** BM 使用 `condition_sample()`，因为全连接网络需要基于可见单元进行条件采样，而非确定性的隐藏层计算。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:94
msgid "Code Examples"
msgstr "代码示例"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:96
msgid "Restricted Boltzmann Machine (RBM)"
msgstr "受限玻尔兹曼机（RBM）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:98
msgid ""
"The following example demonstrates how to use the "
"`RestrictedBoltzmannMachine` class for basic model training. You can define "
"the number of visible and hidden nodes, and customize the initialization of "
"quadratic terms and linear biases."
msgstr ""
"以下示例演示如何使用 `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine` "
"类进行基本模型训练。您可以定义可见节点和隐藏节点的数量，并自定义二次项和线性偏置的初始化。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:163
msgid "Boltzmann Machine (BM)"
msgstr "玻尔兹曼机（BM）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:165
msgid ""
"The following example demonstrates how to use the `BoltzmannMachine` class:"
msgstr "以下示例演示如何使用 `BoltzmannMachine` 类："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:210
msgid "Sampler Switching"
msgstr "采样器切换"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:212
msgid ""
"The Kaiwu SDK provides various samplers. You can choose according to your "
"needs:"
msgstr "Kaiwu SDK 提供多种采样器，您可以根据需求选择："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:224
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:226
msgid "Congratulations on completing the quick start! For the next step:"
msgstr "恭喜您完成快速开始！接下来："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:228
msgid ""
"**Beginner Course:** Check out the [KPP Tutorials](tutorials/index.md) for "
"more practical application examples. Start with `tests/test_rbm.py` for "
"basic execution, then follow `example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb` for a "
"full RBM training walkthrough."
msgstr ""
"**入门课程：** 查看 [KPP 教程](tutorials/index.md) 获取更多实际应用示例。先从 `tests/test_rbm.py` "
"了解基本执行，再跟随 `example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb` 完成完整的 RBM 训练演练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:229
msgid ""
"**Intermediate Tutorial:** Explore generative modeling with fully connected "
"Boltzmann Machines in `example/bm_generation/` (e.g., RNA sequence data "
"augmentation), and learn feature learning & classification with RBM/DBN "
"stacks."
msgstr ""
"**中级教程：** 在 `example/bm_generation/` 中探索全连接玻尔兹曼机的生成建模（例如 RNA 序列数据增强），并学习使用 "
"RBM/DBN 堆叠进行特征学习与分类。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.md:230
msgid ""
"**Advanced Case Study:** Dive into the Q-VAE (Quantum Variational "
"Autoencoder) training pipeline and Q-Diffusion for discrete sequence "
"generation, where a Boltzmann Machine serves as a learnable prior or energy-"
"guided sampler."
msgstr ""
"**高级案例：** 深入 Q-VAE（量子变分自编码器）训练流程和用于离散序列生成的 "
"Q-Diffusion，其中玻尔兹曼机作为可学习先验或能量引导采样器。"

